{"product_id":"smok-novo-kit","title":"SMOK Novo Open Pod Kit - Vape","description":"The SMOK NOVO is an incredibly pocket-friendly vape kit with press fit 1.2O, 2mL refillable cartridge, and 450mAh internal cell. The NOVO features a button-less draw activated firing system capable of 10 to 16W, and the replaceable pods have a built-in coil and ergonomic mouthpiece.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 88.3mm (h) x 24.3mm (w) x 14.3mm (d)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 450mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInput Voltage: 3.3V - 4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Wattage: 10W - 16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Open Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770372151,"sku":"SMOK NOVO OPEN-POD KIT- 450mAH","price":2555.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK-Novo-All-In-One-Starter-Kit-05_grande_2267116e-e956-41bb-866c-4a1df431b7ba.jpg?v=1741710010","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




